From 76a4cfb55749d0c14fdc49865b0cce471b4420d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Snyders <robin@snyders.xyz>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 20:39:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: hotdog: enable bounded TFA9874 speaker output

Add the QUATERNARY_MI2S_RX backend used by the stock design and a conservative TFA9874 codec path for revision 0x0c74. Keep both amplifiers powered down until an active stream has stable clocks, expose read-only diagnostics, and route the first hardware test through the bottom speaker only.
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts   |  49 ++
 sound/soc/codecs/tfa9874.c                    | 484 +++++++++++++++++-
 sound/soc/qcom/sm8150.c                       |  15 +-
 3 files changed, 523 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

